{
 "part": "script/script_0025",
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "script:0025:0E7E",
   "src": "add3311b972b",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>Métannos a la Banda<NL>Sperobo, ¿oíste?<WAIT>Eso de conquistar el<NL>universo nos gusta<WAIT><FACE:4C>Hágannos miembros,<NL>¿o qué?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:0EC6",
   "src": "58649c1fecd5",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>¡¿Aaah?!<NL>¿Qué haces embobado?<WAIT>¿Nos meten o no?<NL>¡Decídete ya, oye!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:0EF5",
   "src": "dd341de991db",
   "t": "<FACE:4C>¡¿No te caemos bien<NL>o qué?!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:0F0A",
   "src": "805093f6ca0e",
   "t": "<FACE:4E>¡Di algo de una vez!<NL>¡¿Eh?!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:0F1D",
   "src": "4b739317445f",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>Estos tipos se ven<NL>de lo peor-robo…<WAIT>¿Los ignoramos-robo?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:0F3E",
   "src": "12b6de1e872f",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>¡¿Qué dijiste, oye?!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:0F49",
   "src": "07cc0cb069e2",
   "t": "<FACE:81>P… pero de peones<NL>descansaremos-robo<WAIT><FACE:7D>¿Por qué-robo?<NL><WAIT>Se ven fuertes-robo<NL>y el mérito, nuestro<WAIT><FACE:7F>Ya veo-robo<NL><WAIT>Los regaños del jefe<NL>se los pasamos-robo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:0FBF",
   "src": "024b0d5c965e",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>¡Dejen de murmurar<NL>de una vez!<WAIT>¡¿Nos meten o no?!<NL><WAIT>¡¿Qué deciden, oye?!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:0FF1",
   "src": "d389fbce13b1",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>N… ni modo-robo…<NL><WAIT>S… si tanto insisten,<NL>los aceptamos-robo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1015",
   "src": "f4898bb54c8f",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>¡¿En serio, oye?!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1020",
   "src": "67ada10b5963",
   "t": "<FACE:4C>¡Lo logramos, órale!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:102B",
   "src": "2367551adc96",
   "t": "<FACE:4E>¡Somos la Banda<NL>Sperobo, eh!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:103F",
   "src": "34d6df0af71e",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>P… pero ustedes son<NL>solo aprendices-robo…<WAIT>O… obedecen en todo<NL>lo que digamos-robo…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1072",
   "src": "82ea4923bf97",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>¡Trato hecho, oye!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1080",
   "src": "79ecb3acc2ce",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>…Qué sensación más<NL>rara-robo…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1094",
   "src": "edca2b26310d",
   "t": "<FACE:03>¡Uaah!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:109A",
   "src": "f39e4cac4103",
   "t": "<FACE:08>¿Qué es este lugar…?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:10A5",
   "src": "aa91f666bbdf",
   "t": "<FACE:08>¿Esto será una<NL>especie de coliseo?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:10BB",
   "src": "5f81749ba77c",
   "t": "<FACE:04>Tengo un mal<NL>presentimiento…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:10CD",
   "src": "a372783be69a",
   "t": "<FACE:7F>¡Damas y caballeros!<NL><WAIT>¡Comienza la «Copa<NL>Sperobo»-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:10F5",
   "src": "e68cab3e8c96",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>Ah, clic-robo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1102",
   "src": "f34f6593a4e0",
   "t": "<FACE:03>¿Qué rayos pasa aquí?<WAIT><FACE:7F>¡Ronda 1: Sperobos<NL>Novatos vs Retadores!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1134",
   "src": "816299152673",
   "t": "<FACE:03>Oigan, ¿nos pusieron<NL>nombre de equipo así?<WAIT><FACE:0B>¡Qué descaro!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1161",
   "src": "de70bd5d8ce0",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>Da igual<NL><WAIT>Sea quien sea,<NL>¡lo haremos pedazos!<WAIT><FACE:19>¡Un servidor<NL>también ayudará!<WAIT><FACE:14>¡Y yo también!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:11A5",
   "src": "55a65a65c68c",
   "t": "<FACE:00>Oigan, ¿y eso de<NL>«novatos»?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:11B6",
   "src": "385f5d8849bd",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>¡Somos los Sperobos<NL>Novatos, oye!<WAIT><FACE:4C>¡Vengan a pelear,<NL>órale!<WAIT><FACE:4E>¡¿Qué, tienen miedo,<NL>eh?!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:11EA",
   "src": "d87f7c1bdc1e",
   "t": "<FACE:08>¿Qué?<NL>¡Si son de mi salón!<WAIT>¿Qué hacen ustedes<NL>en un lugar así?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1216",
   "src": "9df76e0c5cb0",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>¡Cállate ya, oye!<WAIT><FACE:4C>¡Somos la Banda<NL>Sperobo, órale!<WAIT><FACE:4E>¡Novatos, eh!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1244",
   "src": "e0d40e4906b4",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>¿Estos tipos son<NL>tontos o qué?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1254",
   "src": "8aed1519ad0b",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>¡A pelear ya, oye!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1263",
   "src": "19cce5025e79",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>¡A robobatallar-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1274",
   "src": "8770b7afe1b1",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>¡¿Qué dijiste, oye?!<WAIT><FACE:4C>¡Perdimos, órale!<WAIT><FACE:4E>¡Nada mal, <PLAYER>,<NL>eh!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:129B",
   "src": "ac35dc0631fb",
   "t": "<FACE:02>…¿Eso fue un halago…?<WAIT><FACE:06>¡No te lo tomes así!<NL>¡Eres el presidente!<WAIT><FACE:00>Tienes razón<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:12DD",
   "src": "2a03c036623a",
   "t": "<FACE:00>Oigan, ustedes… en<NL>un lugar así…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:12EF",
   "src": "715c62892427",
   "t": "<FACE:80>¡Ronda 1: ganan los<NL>Retadores-roboo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:130D",
   "src": "e68cab3e8c96",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>Ah, clic-robo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:131A",
   "src": "9698a7882903",
   "t": "<FACE:06>Este también me cae<NL>bastante mal"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:132A",
   "src": "36ef8fcc93f6",
   "t": "<FACE:7F>¡Vamos con la<NL>ronda 2-robo!<WAIT>¡Ronda 2: Sperobos<NL>vs Retadores-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1358",
   "src": "30965ab46630",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>Clic, y ya-robo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1364",
   "src": "fb321e66df76",
   "t": "<FACE:00>Estos sí parecen<NL>los de verdad"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1376",
   "src": "b91d84c87eb3",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>Da lo mismo<WAIT><FACE:7F>¡Que empiece la<NL>robobatalla-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1394",
   "src": "076ce53f0bc2",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>¿Eh? ¿Qué pasa-robo?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:13A3",
   "src": "bdbd026f778d",
   "t": "<FACE:81>¡I… imposible-robo!<NL><WAIT>Si ellos perdieron,<NL>¡no ganaremos-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:13DA",
   "src": "31cf70845421",
   "t": "<FACE:81>¡E… eso mismo-robo!<NL><WAIT><FACE:80>¡Adióóós-robo!!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:13F3",
   "src": "07b5ef44d9a6",
   "t": "<FACE:81>Eeeeeh… este…<NL><WAIT>Qué problema-robo…<NL><WAIT>L… la ronda 2<NL>es de Retadores-robo…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:142D",
   "src": "30965ab46630",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>Clic, y ya-robo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1439",
   "src": "e6c3ab214167",
   "t": "<FACE:08>Sí, sí, ya<NL>pasa a la siguiente"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1451",
   "src": "7802ce560b8d",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>Entendido-robo, ehhh…<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1461",
   "src": "cc162801e62b",
   "t": "<FACE:7F>¡Llegó la<NL>semifinal-robo!<WAIT>El rival de la<NL>semifinal es…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1489",
   "src": "6a1a6e5271ae",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>¿Qué pasa-robo?<WAIT><FACE:80>¡Los Sperobos 2 de<NL>la semi huyeron-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:14BD",
   "src": "958c87374224",
   "t": "<FACE:81>¡N… no puede ser!<NL>¡¿Qué hacemos-robo?!<WAIT><FACE:80>¡Yo no sé nada-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:14E1",
   "src": "4c5becaaad46",
   "t": "<FACE:81>E… ehhh-robo…<NL><WAIT>Por abandono ganan<NL>los Retadores… robo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:150B",
   "src": "30965ab46630",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>Clic, y ya-robo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1517",
   "src": "89fb9fac3e45",
   "t": "<FACE:06>¡Ya, basta!<NL><WAIT>¡Hagan la final de<NL>una buena vez!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1539",
   "src": "a095932f9684",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>L… la final es<NL>contra la jefa-robo<WAIT>Habrá un escenario<NL>especial-robo<WAIT><FACE:04>¿Escenario especial?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1577",
   "src": "675cfc5cfb34",
   "t": "<FACE:03>Uy… qué neblina<NL>tan espesa"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1586",
   "src": "c0faea6c2950",
   "t": "<FACE:05>Para esto compré por<NL>correo el «MiraMira»…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:15AB",
   "src": "a7609a0d8930",
   "t": "<FACE:08>¿Eh? ¿Dónde lo habré<NL>guardado?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:15BE",
   "src": "7b4b1fbb6687",
   "t": "<FACE:01>Chicos, no se separen<NL>y sigan juntos…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:15D5",
   "src": "7042c0fad573",
   "t": "<FACE:03>…Justo al decirlo…<NL>¡Aaaaah!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:15EF",
   "src": "d7ef4b5a9af3",
   "t": "<FACE:01>¡Hiyori, no te vayas!<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:15FE",
   "src": "48f2071a7a61",
   "t": "<FACE:03>(¡Oye, no puede ser!)<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:160E",
   "src": "e035d1484bac",
   "t": "<FACE:03>¡Oooye, Hiyoriii!<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:161B",
   "src": "d560ed841566",
   "t": "<FACE:03>¡Fubukiii!<NL><WAIT>¡Mizore, Gousetsuu!<NL><WAIT>¡Respondan!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:163B",
   "src": "3735cfbe1eb0",
   "t": "<FACE:02>¡Ah, ahí están!<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1646",
   "src": "015085738969",
   "t": "<FACE:02>¡Los encontré!<NL>A ver, ehhh…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1656",
   "src": "fa9b0143332f",
   "t": "<FACE:03>¡Hiii, qué frío!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1663",
   "src": "5c7b158faf67",
   "t": "<FACE:73>Tú… ¿quién eres…?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1674",
   "src": "91843de56e09",
   "t": "<FACE:03>¡¿T… t… t… y tú<NL>quién eres?!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:168A",
   "src": "4cb28a6b2738",
   "t": "<FACE:73>Yo… soy Kirika<NL><WAIT>Hoy mi suerte decía…<NL>«encuentro destinado»<WAIT>O sea… tú eres…<NL>…mi destinado… sí…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:16DC",
   "src": "bd6c069d11db",
   "t": "<FACE:04>(Miedo… me da<NL>mucho miedo…)"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:16F2",
   "src": "30c3d9546fba",
   "t": "<FACE:73>Mi destinado…<NL>no te dejaré ir…<WAIT><FACE:03>Awawawa…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1710",
   "src": "9f84f83bb796",
   "t": "<FACE:03>¿Ya se fue la niebla?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:171B",
   "src": "95119785ccd6",
   "t": "<FACE:05>¡<PLAYER>!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1720",
   "src": "9e302420f0b0",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>Vaya, ustedes<NL>estaban por ahí<WAIT><FACE:19>¡Ya están grandotes<NL>para andar perdidos!<WAIT><FACE:14>Eso pasa con los que<NL>no cooperan…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1773",
   "src": "99a3a5017c28",
   "t": "<FACE:73>¿Quién…?<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:177C",
   "src": "5cab479269e4",
   "t": "<FACE:73>Yo… jefa Sperobo…<NL>Kirika de la esquina…<WAIT>Ustedes… todos…<NL>¿son mis destinados?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:17B7",
   "src": "d1b0dbc3a837",
   "t": "<FACE:05>¿De qué hablas?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:17C5",
   "src": "06a31bae8525",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>¡Llegó la final-robo!<NL><WAIT>¡Retadores contra<NL>nuestra jefa Kirika!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:17F6",
   "src": "82f5fcaf4f25",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>O sea que si los<NL>vencemos, ¿ya está?<WAIT><FACE:14>¡Pan comido!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1820",
   "src": "da624e4794e2",
   "t": "<FACE:73>Pelear… también es<NL>el destino…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1833",
   "src": "350fd6fec111",
   "t": "<FACE:80>¡Que empiece la<NL>robobatalla-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1846",
   "src": "164100d1032f",
   "t": "<FACE:81>¡K… Kirika perdió!<NL>¡Ya no hay nada-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1873",
   "src": "e35918dc866a",
   "t": "<FACE:0D>Bien, ahora déjennos<NL>pasar"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1882",
   "src": "e552d387a240",
   "t": "<FACE:73>Murmullos… murmullos…<NL><WAIT>…Así que me ganaste…<NL><WAIT>…No lo olvidaré…<NL>nunca…<WAIT>…No lo… olvidaré…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:18C9",
   "src": "7ebe9fd95030",
   "t": "<FACE:05>Por cierto, ¿ustedes<NL>qué hacían aquí?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:18DE",
   "src": "e27e779ba3d2",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>¡Entramos a la Banda<NL>Sperobo, oye!<WAIT><FACE:4E>¡¿Tienes alguna<NL>queja o qué, eh?!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1907",
   "src": "bf8886d21b05",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>¿Y qué piensan hacer<NL>con esos debiluchos?<WAIT><FACE:4D>¡Vamos a subir alto,<NL>oye!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:193B",
   "src": "e3df43cb99bc",
   "t": "<FACE:06>(Vaya que están<NL>exaltados…)<WAIT><FACE:05>Con tanta fuerza de<NL>sobra, ¿nos ayudan?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:1970",
   "src": "b783c892758a",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>¡¿Por qué, oye?!<WAIT><FACE:4E>¡No nos des órdenes,<NL>eh!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:198F",
   "src": "d3be46ccdb2e",
   "t": "<FACE:07>¿No perdieron contra<NL>nosotros?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:19A0",
   "src": "d373d0c191f3",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>Ug…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:19A7",
   "src": "91e227f9a756",
   "t": "<FACE:4D>¡Kanbatsu se unió al<NL>grupo!<WAIT><FACE:4C>¡Arashi se unió al<NL>grupo!<WAIT><FACE:4E>¡Kyoufuu se unió al<NL>grupo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:19DF",
   "src": "9a4bc2b2c3a5",
   "t": "<FACE:08>¡Ayyy!!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:19E7",
   "src": "3eb8bc6a3f91",
   "t": "<FACE:09>Qué niña más<NL>escalofriante…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0025:19FA",
   "src": "d46193c85e24",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>Se puso todo lúgubre"
  }
 ]
